  "Vyrieš rovnicu $\\sqrt{{@0}} = {@1}$. Zadaj všetky korene oddelené bodkočiarkou.": "Solve the equation $\\sqrt{{@0}} = {@1}$. Enter all roots separated by a semicolon.",
